sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Target admin
  participant E as PackageExporter
  participant I as PackageImporter
  participant T as Deployment transaction
  participant C as CostConfigStore
  E->>I: Package on existing encrypted channel
  I->>I: Check permission, compatibility and C4 bounds
  alt Denied or invalid or outside C4
    I-->>A: Reject intact, no package changes
  else Authorized compatible supported package
    Note over A,I: Force only by explicit choice for the reviewed target state
    I->>T: Validate all included configuration
    alt Invalid values
      T-->>I: Validation failure, prior state retained
      I-->>A: Rejected without package changes
    else Valid values
      Note over A,T: Critical case, target edit occurs after validation
      T->>T: Compare revision at commit
      alt Intervening target edit
        T-->>I: Conflict, roll back ALL package changes
        I-->>A: Visible conflict, target edit retained
        Note over A,I: Any explicit override requires a fresh authorized attempt
      else No intervening edit and override checks satisfied
        T->>C: Apply supplied definitions in atomic package commit
        Note over T,C: Absence preserves both, empty activities preserve activities
        Note over T,C: Currency-only updates currency, no deletion
        T-->>I: Whole package committed
        I-->>A: Deployment complete
      end
    end
  end
